  "static_assertions": [
    "Fresh output directory must be normalized, absolute, new and outside this worktree; mkdir with restrictive umask refuses an existing destination.",
    "Default mode runs only eight metadata/default-environment commands. The attested Apple compiler invocation is --version only and was explicitly included by the parent.",
    "Configure requires an exact helper/proposal/run-directory admission plus the hashed passing review, the pinned lock module, canonical shared lock location and no inherited holder/descriptor override. Lock acquisition uses zero wait.",
    "Configure performs fresh host limits and exact admitted Docker context/container-set checks, requires matching stats IDs and <=100 percent aggregate container CPU, and preserves existing services. These code paths were exercised with mocks, not a live Docker census.",
    "The descriptor check passes the same native mise route used for configure. The separate scratch control proved FD identity and lease survival after its owner was killed; it never acquired the canonical shared lock.",
    "The owned-subprocess runner preserves nonzero exits and timeout evidence and sends both TERM and KILL to its process group, including when the leader exits before an ignoring descendant.",
    "Configure command selects only the outer source/build/cache operation and private prefix. No build or install target is requested. Generated commands and cache contents still require their next review.",
    "Exact retained CMake source shows NO_BUILD_PARALLEL_LEVEL through TryCompile to Ninja and no explicit -j insertion. Helper/docs correctly leave strict probe concurrency UNVERIFIED."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No --configure, CMake project configure, compiler compilation/linking, LLVM build/install, or generated-output runtime checks ran.",
    "Actual outer-configure lease/capacity/admission sequencing remains unexecuted; fresh admission and capacity are still required. No admission file existed during this review.",
    "Live host/container census was assigned to the separate inspector and was not duplicated. Its retained receipts are prerequisites, not reviewer-executed checks.",
    "Private lease/control fixtures are test data and do not authorize any global operation.",
